# geoprocessoR changelog

See the [Releases section](https://github.com/SantanderMetGroup/geoprocessoR/releases) for older version changes

## v0.0.0 (16 Oct 2018)

* First release

## v0.1.0 (16 Apr 2019)

* Bug fix in projectGrid (afecting multimember grids)
* Other minor changes and enhancements

## v0.2.0 (06 Jan 2020)
* New `warpGrid` function for climatological grid warping
* Inlude plot map in polar stereographic projection.
* spatialPlotStereo > warpGrid : auxiliary function to plot in ppolar stereographic projection.

## v0.2.1 (21 Jun 2023)
* Minor updates

## v0.2.2 (22 Jun 2023)
* Update of the DESCRIPTION file

## v0.3.0 (29 May 2026)

* Removed dependency on deprecated/retired `rgdal` and `gdalUtils` packages.
* Updated raster reprojection and warping workflows to use `sf` and `stars` instead.
* Updated package requirements to use modern `sp` versions (`sp >= 2.0-0`).
* Updated `warpGrid` internals while preserving the legacy output as closely as possible. Small differences may appear at the edge of warped domains because modern GDAL may interpolate border cells that the previous `rgdal`/`gdalUtils` workflow returned as `NA`.
* Added tests for `overGrid`, `projectGrid` and `warpGrid`, including regular grids, station data and multimember grids.
* Added `climate4R.datasets` to suggested packages for running examples and tests.